{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"880417697018548274","content":"<@!361351593292988425> (I promised you this) So back when Staaten was going to be a equal part of s4, yall were going to find out JJack got to Roanoke, and stole Gils corpse, along with Lilly.  Using clippings from Lilly, created a Sandiberry industry.  Every potion in s4 used these berries as a base.  Literally the essences used in potion making this year were extraced from those plants.\n\nJJack was going to be one of the major villains for s4, to a point, Reanimating Gils corpse to be a Badberry creation machine (who remembers undead Gil, with Lilly producing black berries instead of red, from day 2 of s4?) which would be easier to make, but had some not so great side effects.\n\nAnyway, Originally there was going to be a train heist to get the undead gil... epic battle, etc.\n\nIn the end, JJack was maknig an army in the wastes so he could get more money from the potion industry\n\nThere was more, but we realized we had to drop Staaten due to all the bloated content overall, and so much of this plot arc was dropped or gone.  So at this point, it could be anyone that had looted Gils grave, and done all this (So if JJack comes back, they might be good instead of bad, so don't meta any of this in the future if it happens)","created_at":"2021-08-26T13:47:48.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880448450444017664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
